\b APE PFAC PSSM 5 Leadership Toolkit: AMA 11 Bibliography\b0\par
\par
\b Project note\b0\par
Rosie Bartel is the first acknowledgement and lived-experience source for this project. Her story is a story and resources anchor, not a substitute for the formal research evidence base. The bibliography below includes research, standards, toolkits, and public story resources that inform the APE PFAC PSSM 5 Leadership Toolkit.\par
